flowchart TB
    subgraph SRC[Telemetry Sources]
      APP[Applications]
      K8S[Kubernetes]
      NET[Network Fabric]
      STG[Storage]
      CLD[Cloud Services]
    end

    SRC --> COL[Agents / Exporters / OpenTelemetry Collectors]
    COL --> PROC[Processing / Enrichment / Sampling / Routing]

    PROC --> MET[Metrics Store]
    PROC --> LOG[Log Store]
    PROC --> TRC[Trace Store]
    PROC --> EVT[Event / Audit Store]

    MET --> CORR[Correlation / Service Context]
    LOG --> CORR
    TRC --> CORR
    EVT --> CORR

    CORR --> DASH[Dashboards]
    CORR --> ALERT[Alerting / Routing]
    CORR --> SLO[SLI / SLO / Error Budget]

    DASH --> OPS[SRE / NOC / Engineering]
    ALERT --> OPS
    SLO --> OPS
    ALERT --> SOC[SOC / Security Operations]
